{
  "title": "104: Al-Humaza الهمزة",
  "code": "02",
  "data": "بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ\nIn the name of Allah, the Beneficent, the Merciful.\nوَيْلٌ لِّكُلِّ هُمَزَةٍ لُّمَزَةٍ (1)\nWoe to every slanderer, defamer,\nٱلَّذِى جَمَعَ مَالًا وَعَدَّدَهُۥ (2)\nWho amasses wealth and considers it a provision (against mishap);\nيَحْسَبُ أَنَّ مَالَهُۥٓ أَخْلَدَهُۥ (3)\nHe thinks that his wealth will make him immortal.\nكَلَّا لَيُنۢبَذَنَّ فِى ٱلْحُطَمَةِ (4)\nNay! he shall most certainly be hurled into the crushing disaster,\nوَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلْحُطَمَةُ (5)\nAnd what will make you realize what the crushing disaster is?\nنَارُ ٱللَّهِ ٱلْمُوقَدَةُ (6)\nIt is the fire kindled by Allah,\nٱلَّتِى تَطَّلِعُ عَلَى ٱلْأَفِْٔدَةِ (7)\nWhich rises above the hearts.\nإِنَّهَا عَلَيْهِم مُّؤْصَدَةٌ (8)\nSurely it shall be closed over upon them,\nفِى عَمَدٍ مُّمَدَّدَةٍۭ (9)\nIn extended columns.",
  "merits": "This Surah was revealed in Makkah and it has 9 ayaat. The Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) said that the reward for reciting this Surah can be compared to ten times the number of disbelievers who were present in Makkah.\nReciting Surah al-Humazah in compulsory prayers keeps a person safe from poverty. Sustenance comes towards him. His death will not be of a sudden and terrifying nature. This Surah is also a cure for pain in the eyes and should be recited before blowing gently into the eyes for relief from pain. Keeping this Surah in a talisman around one’s neck acts as a protection from the ‘evil eye’."
}
